title: Raritan PX-2000 Family: PDU Inlet Sensor State (summary)
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment/raritan
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the state of the inlet sensors of the Raritan PX-2000
 family of intelligent rack power distribution units (iPDUs).
 The check displays the measured value of the sensor.

item:
 The inletLabel, for example {{I1}}, resulting in {{Input I1}}.
 A missing label uses {{Inlet <ID>}}. Multiple PDUs include the PDU ID.
 Duplicate labels include the inlet identity to keep services distinct.

discovery:
 One service per inlet with supported electrical measurements.
 Residual-current-only inlets do not create an electrical summary.
 Outlet readings are never substituted for inlet readings.
